   "additionalProperties": false,
   "description": "The way out of a state (R-UX-002: an empty state has a way back): the suite presses `click`, then expects the\nstate to be gone (backlog B-09: a \"Clear filters\" with no handler passed every check).",
   "properties": {
    "click": {
     "title": "Click",
     "type": "string"
